&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;（５）資本金の額の変更&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　今回の株式分割に際して、資本金の額の変更はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
